  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>Show off your love for NutritionFacts.org with these limited-edition <a href=\"https://www.customink.com/fundraising/nutritionfactsorg-summer-2020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">products</a>!  This summer, we’ve got brand new designs on a tee, tank, and mask. Funds raised help my team and I continue to bring you the bite-sized lifestyle medicine information you count on. <a href=\"https://www.customink.com/fundraising/nutritionfactsorg-summer-2020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get the swag here</a>. </p>\n<h4>New Webinar: The Human Health Implications of Plant-Based and Cultivated Meat for Pandemic Prevention and Climate Mitigation</h4>\n<p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-64509 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG-1024x991.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG-1024x991.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG-960x929.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG-768x743.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG-720x697.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG-540x523.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Meat-Alternative-IG.png 1145w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 207px) 100vw, 207px\"/>In my new book <em><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to Survive a Pandemic</a></em> and my last <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/how-to-survive-a-pandemic-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/how-to-survive-a-pandemic-digital\">COVID-19 webinar</a> I marveled at the constellation of new consumer choices in the dairy and meat aisle helping to innovate us out of our precarious situation with regards to the pandemic threats posed by animal agriculture. Plant-based meats, milks, and egg products—as well as even more pioneering approaches involving cellular agriculture—could also offer enormous benefits for the climate crisis. But what are the nutritional and personal human health effects of eating products like Beyond Meat and the Impossible Burger, or even actual animal products grown without the animals?<br/>\n <br/>\nI did a deep dive and crafted a dozen videos on the topic that I’m going to unveil in a 2-hour live webinar with Q&amp;A at 2pm ET on August 26:<br/>\n <br/>\n1.   The Environmental Impacts of Plant-Based Meat Alternatives<br/>\n2.   Are Beyond Meat and the Impossible Burger Healthy?<br/>\n3.   Are Pea and Soy Protein Isolates Harmful?<br/>\n4.   Plant-Based Meat Alternatives Put to the Test<br/>\n5.   The Health Effects of Mycoprotein (Quorn) Products<br/>\n6.   What About the Heme in Impossible Burgers?<br/>\n7.   Does Heme Iron Cause Cancer?<br/>\n8.   Heme-Induced N-Nitroso Compounds and Fat Oxidation<br/>\n9.   Is Heme the Reason Meat Is Carcinogenic?<br/>\n10. The Human Health Effects of Cultivated Meat: Food Safety<br/>\n11. The Human Health Effects of Cultivated Meat: Antibiotic Resistance<br/>\n12. The Human Health Effects of Cultivated Meat: Chemical Safety<br/>\n <br/>\nAll of these videos will eventually be available for free on NutritionFacts.org, but if you don’t want to wait, you can watch it all now by joining me in this live webinar and get your burning questions answered.</p>\n<p>UPDATE: The digital download of this webinar’s videos is now <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/videos/products/plant-based-and-cultivated-meat-digital\">available here</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Last day to register:</strong> August 19th<br/>\n<strong>Webinar date &amp; time:</strong> August 26th, 2pm ET<br/>\n <br/>\nAnd if you missed my last webinar on my latest B12 recommendations, you can now get the <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/b12-recommendations-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/b12-recommendations-digital\">digital download of those videos</a>.</p>\n<h4>How to Survive a Pandemic – Paperback Edition</h4>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-64531 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/HTSP-PPC-Paperback-Plain-White-Out-Now-1920-x-1080-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>After first being released only in audio and digital format, my newest book is now available for paperback pre-order and will be out on August 18. <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pre-order</a> it today! <p></p>\n<p>If you haven’t seen it yet, we’ve put up a resource page all about COVID-19 with videos, links to my pandemic blog post and special Q&amp;A sessions, my DIY hand sanitizer recipes, and more. Check it out <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>. </p>\n<p>My 17-video series on COVID-19 is wrapping up, so you can now see all of the videos on the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">topic page</a>. </p>\n<p>And I recently did an interview with The Daily Mail for their article on factory farms and pandemics: <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/debate/article-8490351/More-giant-factory-farms-inevitably-mean-create-deadly-pandemics.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/debate/article-8490351/More-giant-factory-farms-inevitably-mean-create-deadly-pandemics.html\">read it here</a>. </p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Fasting Infographic Available</h4>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-64511 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-1024x1023.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-1024x1023.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-960x959.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-768x767.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-720x719.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Fasting-Soup-IG.png 1081w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>New subscribers to my newsletter will be receiving an infographic on the latest fasting research. You can sign up <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\">here</a>. </p>\n<div> </div>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Doctor and Dietitian Q&amp;A</h4>\n<p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-64545 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Greger and Julieanna Hever\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-1200x1199.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/Doctor-Dietitian-Q-A-IG-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>Join me for a live Instagram Q&amp;A with one of my favorite dietitians and dearest friends, <a href=\"https://plantbaseddietitian.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://plantbaseddietitian.com/\">Julieanna Hever</a>.<br/>\nHead over to the <a href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\">NutritionFacts.org Instagram</a> page on 8/17 at 3pm ET to get the answers to your health and nutrition questions.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"534\" height=\"173\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px\"/></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-avoid-covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-64533 size-medium\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-960x540.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/11-–-How-to-Avoid-COVID-19-1.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-avoid-covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to Avoid COVID-19</a></p>\n<p>COVID-19 prevention, and how long can the SARS-CoV-2 coronavirus survive on surfaces like paper?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/where-did-the-covid-19-coronavirus-come-from/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-64535 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-960x540.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/3-Where-Did-the-COVID-19-Coronavirus-Come-From.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/where-did-the-covid-19-coronavirus-come-from/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Where Did the COVID-19 Coronavirus Come From?</a></p>\n<p>The role wet markets, wildlife trafficking, and pangolins have played in the emergence of SARS-CoV-2.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/covid-19-symptoms-vs-the-flu-a-cold-or-allergies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-64537 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-960x540.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/07/7-–-COVID-19-Symptoms-vs.-the-Flu.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/covid-19-symptoms-vs-the-flu-a-cold-or-allergies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">COVID-19 Symptoms vs. the Flu, a Cold, or Allergies</a></p>\n<p>What does clinical course of COVID-19 look like for both those who survive and those who don’t? How the symptoms compare to the flu.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Live Q&amp;As TODAY, July 23</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-53879 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>today</strong></em> is the day. Thanks to a new software we are using, I can now stream to both places at once!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook AND YouTube Live</strong>: At 1:00 p.m. ET TODAY, July 23 go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> OR <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">YouTube</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://NutritionFacts.org/subscribe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://NutritionFacts.org/subscribe&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFgqRXwl6Nx3YWNC7KJOXz7iImpvw\"><u><b>here</b></u></a><b> </b>and watch my live presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEz71GSkEO7c0lf0PbtFQBBFE255Q\"><strong>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</strong></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNG6eIv2PRBSXxyrvDowNdWMY4D9Zw\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFi9CT3XTg6m0jdS4lw9bhd7rnltw\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNF4s9kmYX_dXIaouCFuzUUaOcgHeA\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHTI6QAS4Tz7Dx9NHW2zDoX3knUJA\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1595059440987000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEnLvygza34nB81rac8Kp8zqULuWw\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>\n<div> </div>"
